    "description":  "Freezes the game and plays a video or sound inside Geometry Dash when you die at a specific percentage. Put \u003ccy\u003e.mpg\u003c/c\u003e videos (MPEG-1) or mp3/ogg/wav files in the mod\u0027s media folder. Use the \u003ccy\u003eTroll Folder\u003c/c\u003e button in the pause menu to open it.",
